        {
          "title": "婚礼赞助",
          "content": "<p>一个国外的创业者由于还没有成功，为婚礼的费用发愁。</p>\n<p>他在网上发帖，询问有没有公司愿意赞助他的婚礼。作为回报，他将在婚礼上展示它们的名字。</p>\n<p>结果有26家公司赞助他，下面就是婚礼当天的样子。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202510/bg2025103005.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202510/bg2025103006.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202510/bg2025103007.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "婚礼赞助",
              "url": "https://x.com/dagorenouf/status/1982369609387827247"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202510/bg2025103005.webp",
