        {
          "title": "编译器发展状况",
          "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202511/bg2025110612.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>本文是一篇综述，介绍目前编译器工具的总体发展状况。</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "编译器发展状况",
              "url": "https://abhinavsarkar.net/notes/2025-compiler-backend-survey/"
            }
